 "severity": "warning", "text": "VLAN rozhran\u00ed na fyzick\u00e9m portu, kter\u00fd je z\u00e1rove\u0148 v bridge \u2013 VLAN obch\u00e1z\u00ed bridge.", "objects": ["vlan20-e1 (vid 20) na ether1"]}, {"code": "hw_offload_note", "severity": "info", "text": "P\u0159ed migrac\u00ed ov\u011b\u0159 hardwarov\u00fd offload: na n\u011bkter\u00fdch star\u0161\u00edch \u010dipech p\u0159epne vlan-filtering provoz na CPU (viz dokumentace MikroTik Bridge Hardware Offloading).", "objects": []}], "summary": {"bridges": 3, "ports": 6, "vlan_interfaces": 2, "bridge_vlans": 0}}, "plan": {"ok": true, "target_bridge": "bridge", "steps": ["Port ether1: do bridge bridge, pvid 1 (trunk)", "Port ether2: do bridge bridge, pvid 1", "Port ether3: do bridge bridge, pvid 10", "Port ether4: do bridge bridge, pvid 20", "VLAN 10: tagged bridge, ether1; untagged ether3", "VLAN 20: tagged bridge, ether1; untagged ether4", "Vytvo\u0159it vlan10 (vid 10) na bridge, p\u0159esunout adresy a DHCP z br-vlan10", "Vytvo\u0159it vlan20 (vid 20) na bridge, p\u0159esunout adresy a DHCP z br-vlan20", "Odstranit bridge br-vlan10", "Odstranit bridge br-vlan20", "Zapnout vlan-filtering na bridge"], "script": "# NAHLED migrace VLAN - vygenerovano controllerem, NESPOUSTET bez kontroly\n# Doporuceni: provadet z konzole/MAC-Winboxu, ne pres sit, ktera se prave meni.\n{\n/interface bridge port set [find interface=\"ether1\"] bridge=\"bridge\" pvid=1\n/interface bridge port set [find interface=\"ether2\"] bridge=\"bridge\" pvid=1\n/interface bridge port set [find interface=\"ether3\"] bridge=\"bridge\" pvid=10\n/interface bridge port set [find interface=\"ether4\"] bridge=\"bridge\" pvid=20\n/interface bridge vlan add bridge=\"bridge\" vlan-ids=10 tagged=\"bridge,ether1\" untagged=\"ether3\" comment=\"mtc: migrace VLAN\"\n/interface bridge vlan add bridge=\"bridge\" vlan-ids=20 tagged=\"bridge,ether1\" untagged=\"ether4\" comment=\"mtc: migrace VLAN\"\n/interface vlan add name=\"vlan10\" interface=\"bridge\" vlan-id=10 comment=\"mtc: migrace VLAN\"\n/ip address set [find address=\"10.0.10.1/24\" interface=\"br-vlan10\"] interface=\"vlan10\"\n/ip dhcp-server set [find name=\"dhcp-v10\"] interface=\"vlan10\"\n/interface vlan add name=\"vlan20\" interface=\"bridge\" vlan-id=20 comment=\"mtc: migrace VLAN\"\n/interface bridge port remove [find interface=\"vlan10-e1\"]\n/interface vlan remove [find name=\"vlan10-e1\"]\n/interface bridge port remove [find interface=\"vlan20-e1\"]\n/interface vlan remove [find name=\"vlan20-e1\"]\n/interface bridge remove [find name=\"br-vlan10\"]\n/interface bridge remove [find name=\"br-vlan20\"]\n/interface bridge set [find name=\"bridge\"] vlan-filtering=yes\n}\n", "blockers": [], "warnings": ["Firewall, interface-listy, DHCP relay a dal\u0161\u00ed odkazy na odstran\u011bn\u00e9 bridge/VLAN rozhran\u00ed controller zat\u00edm nekontroluje \u2013 zkontroluj je ru\u010dn\u011b."]}}, "/api/admin/tenants/061b0f18-cf0a-4a0a-83f8-f5e9d813870c/devices/06813aef-ac70-438a-a7d6-7859862f16ed/backups/2/diff": {"diff": "--- p\u0159edchoz\u00ed\n+++ aktu\u00e1ln\u00ed\n@@ -1 +1 @@\n-/system identity set name=gw\n+/system identity set name=gw2\n", "previous_id": 1}}, "tid": "061b0f18-cf0a-4a0a-83f8-f5e9d813870c", "gw": "06813aef-ac70-438a-a7d6-7859862f16ed", "sw": "c98a55a0-459a-4cc5-823b-67fa7d9cd27c", "sid": "a965789c-1657-49cc-9207-dfaa5674db7a"}